/* The offline server code, built into the client (offline mode, section 6). In the repo this is always empty:
running from source, the client reads src/server straight from disk instead (functions/offline.nvgt). A release
build (build/tools.py) fills it with the whole server, then puts this empty version back after compiling, so the
filled copy only ever exists inside cfc.exe and players have no loose server file to see or delete. It is an array
of small pieces, not one string: a single string constant of the server's size (about 800 KB) breaks the compiled
bytecode, so the exe fails to load ("LoadByteCode failed"); 8 KB pieces load fine. */
const string[] offline_server_code = {};
